                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "NjUwI",
                  "name": "t",
                  "fill": "$muted",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "1. Prose: $ui (--font-ui) at $md-body 14 px, line height 1.6, $text; the text column at most 980 px ($md-measure), GitHub’s content width, centred on /md, full width in the overlay.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.6,
                  "fontFamily": "$mono",
                  "fontSize": "$type-body",
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "y3c5lB",
                  "name": "t",
                  "fill": "$muted",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "2. Headings: $md-h1 22, $md-h2 17, $md-h3 15, weight 600, line height 1.3; a 1 px $border hairline under h1 and h2; $space-2 above a heading.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.6,
                  "fontFamily": "$mono",
                  "fontSize": "$type-body",
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "qmtdT",
                  "name": "t",
                  "fill": "$muted",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "3. Inline code: $mono (--font-mono) at $md-code 12.5 px on $surface-2 (--ui-surface-2) with a 1 px $border, radius 2, padding 1 px 5 px.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.6,
                  "fontFamily": "$mono",
                  "fontSize": "$type-body",
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "zQr2W",
                  "name": "t",
                  "fill": "$muted",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "4. Code block: $mono 12.5 px, line height 1.6, on $sunken (--ui-bg-sunken) with a 1 px $border, radius 2, padding $space-3 $space-4; tokens $code-* (.tok-*); a wide block scrolls inside itself, a 2 px $faint thumb.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.6,
                  "fontFamily": "$mono",
                  "fontSize": "$type-body",
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "tXRzD",
                  "name": "t",
                  "fill": "$muted",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "5. Table: 1 px $border outside and between cells, the header row on $surface-2 at weight 600, cells 13 px with 6 px 10 px padding; a header cell does not wrap and a code span in a cell does not break; a wide table scrolls inside itself.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.6,
                  "fontFamily": "$mono",
                  "fontSize": "$type-body",
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "iBVIp",
                  "name": "t",
                  "fill": "$muted",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "6. Task item: a 14 px disabled checkbox on $surface-2 with a 1 px $border, radius 2, the check in $muted.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.6,
                  "fontFamily": "$mono",
                  "fontSize": "$type-body",
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "mY1xn",
                  "name": "t",
                  "fill": "$muted",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "7. Block quote: a 2 px $border rule at the left, $space-3 before the text, the text $muted.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.6,
                  "fontFamily": "$mono",
                  "fontSize": "$type-body",
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "NRy9N",
                  "name": "t",
                  "fill": "$muted",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "8. Links: $accent (--ui-accent), underlined; md-unlinked keeps the words in $text and prints the address in $faint after them; md-image-text prints the alt text and the address in $muted; a shown image fits the column with a 1 px $border.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.6,
                  "fontFamily": "$mono",
                  "fontSize": "$type-body",
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "JFkh1",
                  "name": "t",
                  "fill": "$muted",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "9. Space: $space-4 between blocks, $space-1 between list items, $space-2 of list indent; the body padding $space-5 at 1200 px and $space-4 at 390 px.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.6,
                  "fontFamily": "$mono",
                  "fontSize": "$type-body",
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "ecFr6",
                  "name": "t",
                  "fill": "$muted",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "10. Overlay header: the file name 14 px 600 and the size 12 px $muted in $ui; the toggle in $mono 12.5 px, [x] in $text and [ ] in $muted; open full width 12 px $accent underlined; the close button 32 px on $surface-2 with a $border. At 390 px the controls wrap under the name.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.6,
                  "fontFamily": "$mono",
                  "fontSize": "$type-body",
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "nGyYl",
                  "name": "t",
                  "fill": "$muted",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "11. Page header: the path in $mono 13 px $text with the size in $muted; a knowledge file reads <project> / <path>; the same toggle; no close.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.6,
                  "fontFamily": "$mono",
                  "fontSize": "$type-body",
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "QzGiu",
                  "name": "t",
                  "fill": "$muted",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "12. Notes (cut, error, empty): one sentence at 13 px $muted, centred, padding $space-5 $space-4, the shape of .preview-note today.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.6,
                  "fontFamily": "$mono",
                  "fontSize": "$type-body",
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "v8x2M",
                  "name": "t",
                  "fill": "$muted",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "13. Light theme: the light value of every token; $sunken is the light well #e3e9eb, a step under $surface-2, because --ui-bg-sunken's formula gives a dark well under dark text.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.6,
                  "fontFamily": "$mono",
                  "fontSize": "$type-body",
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
